first adds `wired the lexer` as [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a sub-bullet under Task Link 2, so the unchanged close writes it to[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that task's Work Log. Bob Mac Capture highlights, previews, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]submits the same drafts, and every mistake is caught loudly before [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]anything is written.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]close_work_log_entries.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/close_work_log_entries.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-2z[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-2z/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close planner inserts typed Work Log entries and reports them[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: add the `log` entries to the close spec and CloseSelection. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Validate each target, append the entry sub-bullets under their numbered [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]links before the unchanged close runs, and report `pomodoro_close.log` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus `tasks[].typed_work_log` in JSON and human output. Grammar comes in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the next phase, so the tests build specs directly.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lex, parse, chain, and document the =x Work Log tail[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add one shared tail lexer for `bob capture` and `capture-parse`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](index spans, the `pomodoro_close_log_text` editing state, precise [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnostics, `\\` escapes). Add chain splitting for leading operators and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trailing starts, help text, docs/capture.md, and CLI integration tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture highlights, previews, and submits close Work [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]Log entries[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode `log` and `typed_work_log`, color index chips, and add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pending state for a dangling index. Show typed entries on the close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]card, extend the teaching hint, and add real-bob fixtures, tests, README[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]updates, and green macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install bob, verify end to end with dry runs, and hand Bryan [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]the Mac steps[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: reinstall bob on this host and (best effort) on the MacBook. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Verify the grammar against the live vault with dry runs only, never [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]closing a real session, and give Bryan the checklist for installing the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Mac app.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-2z","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-2z.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-95ece047bb1fe9938b679a42b3147e2b","started_at":"2026-09-30T22:48:32.535515+00:00","state":"